and some good company.

1073
01:04:14,455 --> 01:04:17,759
ANIYA: (ON PHONE)
<i>Well, Sarah, honestly,</i>
<i>I don't think</i>

1074
01:04:17,826 --> 01:04:20,994
<i>you should be driving</i>
<i>a car while you're sleeping.</i>

1075
01:04:22,296 --> 01:04:23,297
