1090
01:05:24,091 --> 01:05:27,629
It's gonna end after this.
No more nightmares.

1091
01:05:28,228 --> 01:05:31,265
No more sleepwalking, right?
Come here.

1092
01:05:34,001 --> 01:05:36,403
You got this.
You're very strong.

1093
01:05:36,470 --> 01:05:40,240
