away from me.

1177
01:13:07,989 --> 01:13:10,725
I'll never let that happen,
do you hear me?

1178
01:13:11,491 --> 01:13:13,594
Never ever.

1179
01:13:22,570 --> 01:13:25,039
Yeah, that sounds doable.

1180
01:13:25,106 --> 01:13:28,009
And we don't need
